<title>YEMEN: Bunker fuel line fron Aden refinery on fire.</title>
<headline>Bunker fuel line fron Aden refinery on fire.</headline>
<dateline>ADEN, Yemen 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fire struck a 35-km (22 mile) pipeline carrying bunker fuel from Yemen's ageing refinery to the nearby port of Aden on Monday, eyewitnesses said.</p>
<p>Officials were not immediately available for comment on the cause of the fire, the extent of damage or how long supplies of bunker fuel from the port would be disrupted.</p>
<p>Firefighters were trying to control the blaze that apparently damaged part of the pipeline, most of which lies underground parallel to a main highway, they said.</p>
<p>Police diverted traffic to nearby roads.</p>
</text>
